              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Dawidi bo n’abagabisha b’ingabo barobanurira ibikorwa bamwe bo mu ba Asafu no mu ba Hemani no mu ba Yedutuni, kugira ngo baririmbe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu Giheburayo handitswe ngo, Kugira ngo bavugishwe n’Imana (no muri 2 na 3 n’uko).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " bavugira inanga n’amakembe n’ivyitwa matowazi; igitigiri c’abakora ico gikorwa, uko bāgenda bakūranwa, bār’ aba: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abo mu ba Asafu ni Zakuri na Yosefu na Netaniya na Asharela, abana ba Asafu nyene, kandi bāgabga na we, yaririmba uk’ umwami amubgirije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba Yedutuni, abahungu biwe ni Gedaliya na Seri na Yeshaya, na Shimeyi na Hashabiya na Matitiya, abo ukw ari batandatu; bāgabga na se Yedutuni nyene, yaririmba avugira inanga, akengurukira Uhoraho, amutazira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba Hemani, abahungu biwe ni Bukiya na Mataniya na Uziyeli, na Shebuweli na Yerimoti na Hananiya, na Hanani na Eliyata na Gidaliti, na Romamuti‐ezeri na Yoshibekasha na Maloti, na Hotiri na Mahaziyoti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.24.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 24:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bose bār’ abahungu ba Hemani, kamenyi w’umwami amumenyera ivy’ Imana; kukw Imana yateye Hemani icubahiro, ikamuha abana b’abahungu cumi na bane n’abakobga batatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.15.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ngo 15:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.12.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 12:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bose bāgabga na se mu kuririmbira mu ngoro y’Uhoraho, bavuza ivyitwa matowazi n’amakembe n’inanga, ngo bashitse igikorwa co mu ngoro y’ Imana; kandi Asafu na Yedutuni na Hemani, umwami ni we yagenda ababgiriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.23.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ngo 23:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw igitigiri cabo, hamwe na bagenzi babo bāri bigishijwe kuririmbira Uhoraho, abahinga bose, bār’ amajana abiri na mirongumunani n’umunani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze bapfinda ubupfindo, ngo barābe ingene bagiye gukurikirana mu bikorwa, bose bapfinda kumwe, abato n’ abakuze, abigisha n’abigishwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
